<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 8,000 T lentils to France, Turkey.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 8,000 T lentils to France, Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment For Cereal Processing And Trade (GECPT) has confirmed the sale of 8,000 tonnes of lentils to French and Turkish companies, an official spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said 3,000 tonnes were sold to France's Comitrex at $516 fob plus $5 by containers, and 5,000 tonnes to Turkey's Ozkahaman at $485 free on truck.</p>
<p>The amount sold was part of the 12,000 tonnes offered for sale on February 14.</p>
<p>Shipment would be between March 15 and April 15.</p>
</text>
